#ASSERT `reg 77(2) the FCA may take the measure` (JUST FALSE) `reg 77(2)(a)(i) cancel or suspend any permission which an authorised person has to carry on a regulated activity` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "Paragraph (2) applies if" and it does not (marginal reading (a); was NOTHING)
